Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix PageSnap deployment for Railway

- Remove opencv from requirements (camera only works locally)
- Make camera code conditional with CAMERA_AVAILABLE flag
- Fix startup crash when page_snap is None
- Update Sidebar to point to new Railway scanner URL
- Use nixpacks builder instead of deprecated heroku

Scanner now live at: https://scanner-production-1d59.up.railway.app
